+			// using DXGI exclusive fullscreen via vkd3d-proton on Wine
+			// produce exactly this shape: parent X11 window stays at its
+			// 1×1 placeholder size, the swapchain renders into a child
+			// override window via the gamescope_swapchain bypass layer at
